From: pulpoff <pashkovsky@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] screenShield: Connect the power save handler only where mutter
 exports the mode

The screen shield goes back to the clock page when the display leaves the
ON state, reading MetaMonitorManager:power-save-mode and comparing it with
Meta.PowerSaveMode.ON. The mutter the phones run keeps the power save mode
private: MetaMonitorManager has no power-save-mode property and MetaPowerSave
is not introspected, so Meta.PowerSaveMode is undefined. Every change of the
power save mode, i.e. every time the screen goes off or on, threw

  TypeError: can't access property "ON", (intermediate value).PowerSaveMode
  is undefined

Connect the handler only when Meta.PowerSaveMode exists. VibeOS's lock
screen leaves its PIN pad by itself when the screen goes off, so nothing is
lost there.
---
diff --git a/js/ui/screenShield.js b/js/ui/screenShield.js
index 2e0c090..5a5f4a7 100644
--- a/js/ui/screenShield.js
+++ b/js/ui/screenShield.js
@@ -109,12 +109,18 @@ export class ScreenShield extends Signals.EventEmitter {
             this._prepareForSleep.bind(this));
 
         // The unlock prompt is of no use while the display is off; go back to
-        // the clock page whenever the display leaves the ON state.
+        // the clock page whenever the display leaves the ON state. That needs
+        // the power save mode, which only a mutter that exports it can give
+        // (MetaMonitorManager:power-save-mode and Meta.PowerSaveMode). Where
+        // mutter keeps the mode private, every change would throw on the
+        // missing enum, so the handler is not connected at all.
         this._monitorManager = global.backend.get_monitor_manager();
-        this._monitorManager.connectObject('power-save-mode-changed', () => {
-            if (this._monitorManager.power_save_mode !== Meta.PowerSaveMode.ON)
-                this.cancelUnlock();
-        }, this);
+        if (Meta.PowerSaveMode) {
+            this._monitorManager.connectObject('power-save-mode-changed', () => {
+                if (this._monitorManager.power_save_mode !== Meta.PowerSaveMode.ON)
+                    this.cancelUnlock();
+            }, this);
+        }
 
         this._loginSession = null;
         this._getLoginSession();
